us.github.io/post/2024-03-01-accumux/card.jpg" medium="image"><media:title type="plain">Functional-Programming</media:title></media:content><category>C++</category><category>statistics</category><category>numerical-computing</category><category>accumulators</category><category>functional-programming</category><category>header-only</category><category>sicp</category></item></channel></rss>